              "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"58692e88-f3ef-4bb5-964c-2214c02500d3\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/58692e88-f3ef-4bb5-964c-2214c02500d3\"/> В пря­мо­уголь­ном па­рал­ле­ле­пи­пе­де <var data-math-identifier=\"ABCDA\">ABCDA</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"B\">B</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"D\">D</var><sub>1</sub> ребро <var data-math-identifier=\"BC\">BC</var>  =  4, ребро  <span data-inline-latex=\"AB=2\\sqrt{5}\"></span> , ребро <var data-math-identifier=\"BB\">BB</var><sub>1</sub>  =  4. Точка <var data-math-identifier=\"K\">K</var>  — се­ре­ди­на ребра <var data-math-identifier=\"CC\">CC</var><sub>1</sub>. Най­ди­те пло­щадь се­че­ния, про­хо­дя­ще­го через точки <var data-math-identifier=\"B\">B</var><sub>1</sub>, <var data-math-identifier=\"A\">A</var><sub>1</sub> и <var data-math-identifier=\"K\">K</var>.</p>",
